{"seq":4,"slug":"personal-data-infrastructure","title":"个人数据基础设施","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-systems","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure","rating":{"composite":4.32,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 个人数据基础设施 简介\n\n个人数据基础设施关注如何以工程化思维构建属于自己的数据存储、同步与服务体系。在 2026 年，随着 Local-first 架构日趋成熟、SQLite 作为通用应用格式被广泛采纳、Docker 让自托管触手可及，以及 webhook 基础设施工具的标准化，个人开发者已经具备了构建媲美企业级数据平台的条件——而代价仅是一台低功耗设备和一套精心设计的架构。\n\n本 Hub 适用于希望掌控自己数据的开发者：无论你是厌倦了云服务的订阅费和数据锁定，还是想为自己的 Side Project 搭建一套持久、可靠的数据底座，这里都能提供从理论到实战的完整指引。\n\n第一章**Local-first 架构**系统讲解离线优先应用的核心理念，从 CRDTs 的数学原理与工程实现（Yjs、Automerge），到本地持久化方案（IndexedDB、OPFS、SQLite WASM），再到多设备同步协议的设计模式，帮助你理解这一正在重塑个人软件形态的架构范式。\n\n第二章**SQLite 应用实践**深入探讨 SQLite 作为应用文件格式的优势与实战技巧，涵盖 WAL 模式下的并发读写、FTS5 全文搜索、JSON 扩展，以及如何将 SQLite 打造为个人数据仓库——一个统一存储笔记、书签、习惯记录等异构数据的单文件数据库。\n\n第三章**自托管服务**提供从零搭建 Homelab 的完整路径，包括硬件选型（Raspberry Pi 5 到 Mac Mini）、Docker Compose 服务栈编排（Nextcloud、Vaultwarden、Immich 等）、反向代理与 HTTPS 配置，以及通过 Cloudflare Tunnel 实现安全的公网访问。\n\n第四章**个人 API 编排**聚焦于将分散在各平台的个人数据聚合为统一接口，内容涵盖多源数据聚合策略、webhook 管道设计（n8n、Hookdeck）、以及如何设计和实现一套个人数据 API——让你的健康数据、阅读记录、代码统计通过标准 REST/GraphQL 接口统一访问。\n\n推荐学习路径：先从第一章理解 Local-first 的核心理念，第二章掌握 SQLite 作为本地数据引擎的实践技能，第三章搭建自托管服务基础设施，最后通过第四章将所有数据源编排为统一的个人 API。四章内容层层递进，最终形成一套完整的、由你完全掌控的个人数据基础设施。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"local-first-architecture","title":"Local-first 架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/local-first-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crdts-offline-first","title":"CRDTs 与离线优先","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/local-first-architecture/crdts-offline-first"},{"seq":2,"slug":"local-data-persistence","title":"本地数据持久化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/local-first-architecture/local-data-persistence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sync-protocol-design","title":"同步协议设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/local-first-architecture/sync-protocol-design"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sqlite-personal-apps","title":"SQLite 应用实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/sqlite-personal-apps","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sqlite-as-app-format","title":"SQLite 作为应用格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/sqlite-personal-apps/sqlite-as-app-format"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wal-mode-concurrency","title":"WAL 模式与并发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/sqlite-personal-apps/wal-mode-concurrency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"personal-data-warehouse","title":"个人数据仓库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/sqlite-personal-apps/personal-data-warehouse"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"self-hosted-services","title":"自托管服务","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/self-hosted-services","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"homelab-getting-started","title":"Homelab 入门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/self-hosted-services/homelab-getting-started"},{"seq":2,"slug":"docker-compose-stack","title":"Docker Compose 服务栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/self-hosted-services/docker-compose-stack"},{"seq":3,"slug":"domain-tunnel-config","title":"域名与隧道配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/self-hosted-services/domain-tunnel-config"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"personal-api-orchestration","title":"个人 API 编排","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/personal-api-orchestration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aggregate-multi-source-data","title":"聚合多源个人数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/personal-api-orchestration/aggregate-multi-source-data"},{"seq":2,"slug":"webhook-pipeline","title":"Webhook 事件管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/personal-api-orchestration/webhook-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"personal-data-api-design","title":"个人数据 API 设计与实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-data-infrastructure/personal-api-orchestration/personal-data-api-design"}]}]}